[b]Thinking of a better experience for you, we added some news in this Update:
[/b]
[list]
[*] - Localization for 27 Languages;

[*] - New achievements with 160 images to give a new look to your profile;

[*] - Menu improvements;
[/list]

We consider later on, creating new updates to help bring you the most fun on IIN, to stay tuned follow our page on Steam - https://store.steampowered.com/developer/epopeiagames

[b]And check out our new Stealth game Outland Rapture[/b]: https://store.steampowered.com/app/1361900/Outland_Rapture/

Hi everyone,

We just released an update, here are some major changes included:

- several levels have been rebalanced;
- aspect ratios should now work properly;
- some small quality of life solutions;

Enjoy!

